flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> A[Load config]
    A --> B{Valid?}
    B -->|yes| C[(Cache)]
    B -->|no| E[/Report error/]
    C --> D{{Transform}}
    D --> F[Write output]
    D --> G[Audit log]
    F --> H((Done))
    E -->|retry after a long and detailed backoff| A
    G -->|re-audit| D
    F -->|checksum mismatch| B
    H -.->|restart| S
    G --> G
